  "body": "The batch gate on upstream main at `8864176c` (the merge of #1341) is red: the app test build fails to compile, so no app suites or clippy run.\n\n```\nerror[E0063]: missing field `cutting` in initializer of `camcraft_app::tools::Tool`\n   --> crates/app/tests/coarse_rims.rs:119:5\n```\n\n`Tool` gained a `cutting` field (78a23c8b, \"a tool carries cutting data per workpiece material\"). The `Tool` literal in `crates/app/tests/coarse_rims.rs` came in with #1073 (merged as 15ad9289), and both branches were gated against a main that didn't yet have the other. Each was green alone, but they don't build together.\n\nThe other gate steps are green on that sha: geometry 79, cl 49, tools 76, post 381, sim 520, motion 693, ui 765.\n\n**Done means:** `crates/app/tests/coarse_rims.rs` sets the `cutting` field (the same pattern a9a4bddd used for the other literals); `cargo test -p camcraft-app --no-run` builds; the batch gate is green on main again, app suites and clippy included.\n\nFound by the M5 session's post-merge batch gate.\n",
